       <property name="html">
        <string>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Arial'; font-size:14pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:8px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;2. Método de la Falsa Posición (Regula Falsi)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:11pt; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;2.1. ¿Para qué sirve?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;El método de la falsa posición (o regula falsi) es un algoritmo numérico utilizado para encontrar raíces reales de ecuaciones no lineales de la forma:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:6px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;&quot; cellspacing=&quot;2&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;) = 0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;right&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(6)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Al igual que el método de bisección, es un método cerrado que parte de un intervalo [&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;] que encierra la raíz, pero aprovecha la magnitud de los valores de la función en los extremos para aproximarse más rápido a la solución mediante interpolación lineal.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:11pt; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;2.2. Fundamento Matemático&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Se fundamenta en el Teorema de Bolzano, exigiendo que &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;) sea continua en [&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;] y que exista un cambio de signo:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:6px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;&quot; cellspacing=&quot;2&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;) · &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;) &amp;lt; 0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;right&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(7)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;En lugar de dividir el intervalo exactamente a la mitad, se traza una recta secante que une los puntos (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;)) y (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;)). La intersección de esta recta con el eje &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; proporciona la nueva aproximación &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; de la raíz.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:11pt; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;2.3. Fórmulas Principales&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;1. Cálculo de la aproximación (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; Por semejanza de triángulos a partir de la recta secante entre &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; y &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;, se obtiene:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:6px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;&quot; cellspacing=&quot;2&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;      &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; = &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; −      &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
